# Code owners for ds-mvp.
#
# Owners are the two technical co-founders; they are the only accounts with push
# access, and the pipeline is operated only by them.
#
# One limitation is worth stating rather than leaving to be discovered: **CODEOWNERS
# matches paths, never file contents.** The rule "the two technical co-founders own
# every file containing LEGAL-DEFERRED" cannot be expressed here at all. It is
# enforced in two other places instead — `claude-review.yml` checks that no file
# containing the marker was touched unless the issue said so, and
# `claude-automerge.yml` greps the changed files at the head commit and declines to
# merge if any of them carries it. What this file can do is own the paths where such
# markers are most likely to land, which is what the legal block below is.
#
# Requiring review from owners is a branch-protection setting ("Require review from
# Code Owners" on `main`), not something this file turns on.

